* Physical AI - Experiment 19 architecture N: matched replica-null TIA
* Signal TIA plus a replica TIA loaded by dummy G_tot to 0 V. Same A, Rf, Vos. Vlin = Vsig - Vrep. Unity subtractor VCVS.
* Frozen Experiment 9 network A. Weights were not edited.
* Behavioral circuit analysis. Not transistor-level or PCB power.
* A_tia=100000 vos=0 vos_replica=None unmatched=False rout=0 Ileak=0
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
* passive invert in1 -> in1n: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinv1ia in1 inv1m 10000
Rinv1ib in1n inv1m 10000.200002
Einv1amp in1n 0 0 inv1m 100000
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
* passive invert in2 -> in2n: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinv2ia in2 inv2m 10000
Rinv2ib in2n inv2m 10000.200002
Einv2amp in2n 0 0 inv2m 100000
Vref vref 0 DC 1
* passive invert vref -> vrefn: R2/R1=1.0000200002 closed-loop -1 at A=100000
Rinvrefia vref invrefm 10000
Rinvrefib vrefn invrefm 10000.200002
Einvrefamp vrefn 0 0 invrefm 100000
* load-compensated divider vref->tapref: G_load=0.00135041774642313 Ra=425030.827613635 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefa vref tapref 425030.827613635
Rdivrefb tapref 0 1000
* load-compensated divider vrefn->taprefn: G_load=0.000833646933955897 Ra=544815.897488381 Rb=1000 target beta=0.001 (no tap buffer)
Rdivrefna vrefn taprefn 544815.897488381
Rdivrefnb taprefn 0 1000

* h1 input 1 w=+0.683760795348816 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=48749.9920441162 G_phys=2.05128238604645e-05 G_eff=2.05128238604645e-05
Rh1p1n1 in1n h1p 48749.9920441162
* h1 input 2 w=+0.309366783045794 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=107746.969487669 G_phys=9.28100349137382e-06 G_eff=9.28100349137382e-06
