* h1 bias w-  bank=f alpha=0.001 R=1253.18954325804 G_phys=0.000797963887729386 G_eff=7.97963887729385e-07
Rh1bnf1 tapref h1p 1253.18954325804
* replica dummy G_tot for h1: same R as weights/biases, dest=0
Rh1dmy000 0 h1rp 48749.9920441162
Rh1dmy001 0 h1rp 107746.969487669
Rh1dmy002 0 h1rp 1253.18954325804
* feedback TIA h1: Rf=33333.3333333333 A=100000 V(h1sig) = -I(h1p)*Rf*A/(A+1)  (uncompensated)
Eh1tia h1sig 0 0 h1p 100000
Rh1f h1sig h1p 33333.3333333333
* feedback TIA h1r: Rf=33333.3333333333 A=100000 V(h1rep) = -I(h1rp)*Rf*A/(A+1)  (uncompensated)
Eh1rtia h1rep 0 0 h1rp 100000
Rh1rf h1rep h1rp 33333.3333333333
* replica null h1: v(h1lin)=v(h1sig)-v(h1rep) Vos_sig=0 Vos_rep=0
Eh1null h1lin 0 h1sig h1rep 1
* direct bounded ReLU: y=max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))
Bh1relu h1y 0 V = max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))

